{"id":"musulma_n","lemma":"musulmán","pos":"adj","rank":4391,"glosses":["Muslim"],"ipa":"/musulˈman/","forms":{"feminine":"musulmana","masculinePlural":"musulmanes","femininePlural":"musulmanas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-musulm%C3%A1n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom es musulmán.","en":"Tom is a Muslim.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"En esta ciudad hay más musulmanes que cristianos.","en":"There are more Moslems than Christians in this town.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"city"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"Christian","l":"cristiano"}]},{"text":"Pakistán es un país musulmán.","en":"Pakistan is a Muslim country.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"country"},null]},{"text":"¿Es correcto decir que el Corán es la biblia de los musulmanes?","en":"Is it correct to say that the Qur'an is the bible of the Muslims?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693311","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"correct, right"},{"g":"to say"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"Qur'an"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bible"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"El seguidor del Islam se llama musulmán.","en":"A person who follows Islam is known as a Muslim.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"follower"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"Islam"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"flame"},null]}]}